/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  nHeptane -- case-local PARTIAL overlay of the standard record: the Fuller
  diffusion volume, which the catalogue record does not carry.
  `overlayOf nHeptane;` declares this a DELTA: everything else is the catalogue's.

  Source of the value: Fuller atomic diffusion volumes, 7 C x 15.9 + 16 H x 2.31
  (Poling, Prausnitz & O'Connell 5ed Table 11-1, p. 11.11): 148.26.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
overlayOf nHeptane;
variationReason "adds diffusionVolume 148.26 (Fuller), which the catalogue record nHeptane does not carry: Fuller: 7 C x 15.9 + 16 H x 2.31 (Poling, Prausnitz & O'Connell 5ed Table 11-1, p. 11.11).  Added by the case (C513).";

diffusionVolume 148.26;
